WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 27=

01:39.340 --> 01:40.780
(Taiji Palace)
His Majesty summons

01:41.860 --> 01:44.580
Meng Zaishi, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit,

01:44.900 --> 01:47.260
Lu Yan, General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

01:47.700 --> 01:49.540
and Wei Shu of the Censorate!

01:50.180 --> 01:51.060
Meng Zaishi,

01:51.420 --> 01:53.580
you are hereby appointed
Military Governor of North Jing,

01:54.020 --> 01:55.660
with authority over the Eastern,
Western, and Central Circuits.

01:56.060 --> 01:57.140
Receive the decree and give thanks.

01:58.340 --> 01:58.740
I

01:59.340 --> 02:00.260
gratefully accept, Your Majesty.

02:09.220 --> 02:09.660
Your Majesty,

02:10.500 --> 02:12.100
I request permission to depart.

02:13.300 --> 02:13.860
No rush.

02:15.020 --> 02:17.100
General, you may delay your departure.

02:19.580 --> 02:22.060
General Lu Yan has rendered
great service in quelling the rebellion.

02:22.380 --> 02:24.100
You were granted the title
of Marquis of Zhongshan.

02:24.900 --> 02:26.100
Your rank and stipend
shall be increased,

02:26.300 --> 02:27.300
and your descendants

02:27.780 --> 02:29.580
shall inherit your title
for generations to come.

02:33.660 --> 02:35.860
Thank you for your generosity,
Your Majesty!

02:43.220 --> 02:43.980
General Lu...

02:44.820 --> 02:45.100
No,

02:46.020 --> 02:47.140
Marquis of Zhongshan.

02:48.020 --> 02:50.860
You needn't toil in the army anymore.

02:51.420 --> 02:54.100
You can enjoy a life
of wealth and leisure.

02:58.460 --> 02:59.500
Your Majesty, what does this mean?

03:00.460 --> 03:02.940
You personally captured Yu Cheng'an.

03:03.060 --> 03:04.060
Yours was the greatest contribution,

03:04.660 --> 03:06.060
surpassing everyone else's.

03:06.660 --> 03:09.020
I am grateful to Heaven

03:09.580 --> 03:11.180
for giving Huai a new lease on life.

03:11.820 --> 03:12.300
Therefore,

03:13.020 --> 03:14.260
I shall grant a general amnesty

03:14.620 --> 03:16.340
and host a month of palace banquets.

03:17.300 --> 03:19.260
Besides, the weather is cold
and the roads are slippery.

03:19.820 --> 03:21.500
Why not stay at the palace

03:21.540 --> 03:22.780
and rest a few more days, General?

03:23.140 --> 03:23.940
Once the celebrations are over,

03:24.300 --> 03:25.420
you may depart.

03:28.180 --> 03:28.700
Your Majesty,

03:29.620 --> 03:30.620
your imperial wine is exquisite,

03:31.340 --> 03:32.420
and I'd gladly stay to enjoy it.

03:32.900 --> 03:33.900
But if I delay my return,

03:34.260 --> 03:35.660
I fear unrest may break out
in North Jing.

03:38.180 --> 03:39.340
You worry too much, General.

03:40.500 --> 03:42.500
I'll send an envoy to North Jing

03:42.780 --> 03:44.540
to reassure your troops.

03:45.180 --> 03:46.180
Your Majesty may not realize,

03:46.700 --> 03:48.220
but the men of North Jing
are a rough lot.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.420
I fear any envoy you send

03:51.460 --> 03:52.860
may not make it back alive.

03:58.980 --> 04:02.100
Mu Xianqing's death has already
been announced throughout the empire.

04:03.140 --> 04:05.140
If something were to happen
to you too, General,

04:05.860 --> 04:06.980
I fear North Jing

04:07.580 --> 04:09.340
would descend into chaos again,

04:09.340 --> 04:10.780
just as it did when your uncle died.

04:11.380 --> 04:12.700
Another upheaval could follow.

04:26.580 --> 04:27.860
Your Majesty makes a good point.

04:30.140 --> 04:31.580
I'll issue written orders to my deputy.

04:32.380 --> 04:33.660
- Tell him...
- Tell him...

04:35.860 --> 04:37.180
"All is well,

04:37.900 --> 04:39.060
and I'll return shortly."

04:41.180 --> 04:43.020
Then which envoy will Your Majesty send

04:44.780 --> 04:46.100
to die in North Jing?

04:47.300 --> 04:54.200
(Liangyi Hall; Universe in Harmony)

05:03.140 --> 05:04.180
North Jing is a harsh,
bitterly cold place.

05:04.660 --> 05:05.620
Take good care of yourself

05:06.020 --> 05:07.340
on your journey.

05:10.660 --> 05:11.540
Thank you for your concern.

05:13.980 --> 05:14.740
Your Majesty,

05:15.260 --> 05:16.580
in this round of rewards,

05:17.100 --> 05:18.780
haven't you overlooked someone?

05:37.460 --> 05:37.940
Your Highness.

05:47.340 --> 05:48.780
Once the hunt is over,
the bow is cast aside.

05:49.980 --> 05:50.900
Just as I expected.

05:51.940 --> 05:52.900
But why hasn't His Majesty

05:54.500 --> 05:55.700
come after

05:55.700 --> 05:56.940
Yang Si and me yet?

05:57.620 --> 05:58.700
Yang Si aside,

06:00.300 --> 06:01.940
you are His Majesty's son, after all.

06:02.820 --> 06:04.820
Yu Cheng'an's downfall
is already a tremendous blessing.

06:05.740 --> 06:06.780
Now that the rewards have been granted,

06:07.500 --> 06:08.580
you can finally put your mind at ease.

06:09.260 --> 06:10.180
Son...

06:15.140 --> 06:16.020
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
Let me hold the baby!

06:17.180 --> 06:17.700
Careful, careful.

06:18.140 --> 06:18.860
Easy.

06:43.580 --> 06:44.660
Cailian did your hair, didn't she?

06:47.660 --> 06:48.140
That girl...

06:49.820 --> 06:51.540
Your Highness, let me redo it for you.

06:56.220 --> 06:56.740
Chunhua,

06:59.020 --> 06:59.660
tell me,

07:00.340 --> 07:01.340
what would you do

07:02.420 --> 07:03.820
if you suddenly discovered
that someone closest to you

07:04.740 --> 07:05.620
had become unrecognizable,

07:07.460 --> 07:09.220
nothing like the person

07:10.700 --> 07:11.500
you thought you knew?

07:18.420 --> 07:19.180
Greetings, Your Highness.

07:22.340 --> 07:23.820
Well, Wanyao...

07:24.340 --> 07:25.060
Could you...

07:25.820 --> 07:27.220
step out for now?

07:28.660 --> 07:29.580
I just got here,

07:30.220 --> 07:30.860
and you're already kicking me out?

07:32.660 --> 07:33.220
No, it's just...

07:33.900 --> 07:35.980
Your personal guard has been
looking everywhere for you.

07:35.980 --> 07:37.540
He seemed pretty anxious.

07:38.740 --> 07:42.180
(Myriad Blessings Gather)

07:42.780 --> 07:43.300
Your Highness,

07:43.980 --> 07:45.260
the Crown Prince just sent word.

07:45.500 --> 07:46.460
Meng Zaishi couldn't leave the capital.

07:46.740 --> 07:47.620
He was summoned back to the palace.

07:47.940 --> 07:49.660
Lu Yan has been made a marquis
and removed from the Jinwu Guard.

07:50.020 --> 07:50.460
And

07:50.660 --> 07:52.500
Wei Shu and Yan Shang
were summoned, too.

07:58.300 --> 07:59.020
Take me to the palace, quickly!

08:04.780 --> 08:06.180
If I remember correctly,

08:06.340 --> 08:07.620
we've met twice before.

08:08.500 --> 08:09.860
Yet your name

08:11.180 --> 08:13.300
keeps coming up in conversations
around me.

08:14.300 --> 08:15.660
And every time it does,

08:15.780 --> 08:17.940
it leaves quite an impression.

08:18.700 --> 08:19.460
I'm humbled, Your Majesty.

08:21.940 --> 08:22.460
Rise.

08:23.380 --> 08:24.060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:26.620 --> 08:28.620
There was even a rumor that Wanyao

08:29.100 --> 08:31.740
brought a handsome young man
all the way back from Lingnan.

08:32.460 --> 08:33.460
That was you too, wasn't it?

08:34.820 --> 08:35.420
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:36.500 --> 08:37.140
It was me.

08:37.540 --> 08:39.340
I once personally chose you
to marry her.

08:39.540 --> 08:41.340
You agreed without hesitation.

08:42.180 --> 08:43.420
But at the time,

08:43.860 --> 08:48.020
that traitor Yu was still determined
to send her to North Jing.

08:48.540 --> 08:51.660
Becoming her husband would've been
like stepping into a furnace.

08:52.380 --> 08:54.380
You're a clever man.
Surely you knew that.

08:58.540 --> 08:59.700
When I look upon Princess Danyang,

09:00.540 --> 09:01.740
it's like gazing up at the radiant moon.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.020
I saw no burning coals
or blazing furnace.

09:04.900 --> 09:06.340
I was simply overwhelmed by the honor.

09:10.140 --> 09:11.820
And when she shot Zheng Xing dead,

09:11.860 --> 09:13.020
you took the blame for her,

09:13.820 --> 09:15.700
were you overwhelmed by that honor too?

09:21.260 --> 09:21.580
Yes.

09:23.220 --> 09:24.060
I did so

09:25.060 --> 09:26.500
to repay the Princess
for recognizing my worth.

09:27.900 --> 09:30.020
You keep saying how honored you are,

09:30.700 --> 09:32.260
how grateful you are
for her recognition.

09:33.620 --> 09:34.420
Then tell me,

09:36.100 --> 09:37.420
in the incident at the hunting grounds,

09:38.140 --> 09:40.100
what exactly was your role?

09:45.820 --> 09:47.340
- I...
- Don't try telling me

09:47.340 --> 09:49.580
it was all the Crown Prince
and Princess's doing.

09:50.180 --> 09:52.420
I've carefully examined
what happened that night.

09:54.380 --> 09:55.900
You were deeply involved,

09:56.180 --> 09:56.580
weren't you?

10:01.380 --> 10:03.180
Quite impressive for a farmer
from Lingnan.

10:05.660 --> 10:06.420
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

10:09.060 --> 10:11.340
You played a major role
in bringing down Yu's faction.

10:11.940 --> 10:12.740
What have you done wrong?

10:13.140 --> 10:13.580
Your Majesty,

10:15.420 --> 10:17.780
when I was a farmer in Lingnan,

10:18.620 --> 10:19.860
I was fortunate enough to glimpse
the splendor of the court.

10:20.620 --> 10:21.940
I begged the Princess
to give me a chance,

10:22.260 --> 10:23.740
so I could come to Sheng'an
for the imperial examinations.

10:24.780 --> 10:25.700
As a scholar,

10:26.180 --> 10:27.460
all I wanted was to enter public service

10:27.980 --> 10:28.980
and put my education to good use.

10:29.980 --> 10:31.540
But I knew my abilities were modest.

10:32.300 --> 10:34.100
To earn Your Majesty's
and the Princess's favor,

10:35.020 --> 10:36.140
I had to follow Mao Sui's example

10:37.060 --> 10:38.260
and do everything I could

10:38.660 --> 10:39.740
to show off my talents
at every opportunity.

10:40.980 --> 10:41.700
To claim I had no desire

10:42.380 --> 10:44.380
for fame, fortune, glory, or recognition

10:45.380 --> 10:46.180
would be lying to Your Majesty.

10:47.180 --> 10:47.580
Therefore,

10:48.500 --> 10:48.860
I

10:49.460 --> 10:49.980
admit my fault.

10:51.700 --> 10:52.580
Yan Shang,

10:52.740 --> 10:54.140
you keep asking

10:55.340 --> 10:56.740
for my forgiveness,

10:56.740 --> 10:57.700
but in truth,

10:58.100 --> 11:00.820
you're avoiding the real question.

11:02.940 --> 11:03.900
Come closer and answer me.

11:05.460 --> 11:05.820
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:13.060 --> 11:14.100
You know, Wanyao

11:14.900 --> 11:16.740
is the only child of my first wife.

11:17.340 --> 11:19.180
She's also the daughter I cherish most.

11:19.780 --> 11:22.020
She's clever and strong-willed.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.100
Of course,

11:23.700 --> 11:26.500
she can be willful and spoiled at times.

11:27.660 --> 11:28.420
But after

11:29.700 --> 11:31.460
she survived that monster Meng Baiyu

11:31.460 --> 11:32.420
and came home alive,

11:33.020 --> 11:35.580
then smiled so sweetly
in Yu Cheng'an's presence,

11:36.140 --> 11:38.540
I realized my daughter

11:39.340 --> 11:40.340
knows how to endure

11:42.300 --> 11:43.500
and hide her true intentions.

11:51.980 --> 11:54.300
Whether it was Yu Cheng'an or Wei Qiao,

11:54.660 --> 11:56.740
they lost to Wanyao

11:56.740 --> 11:58.220
for one simple reason.

11:58.220 --> 11:58.900
They thought

11:59.220 --> 12:01.300
she was just like Luling,

12:02.060 --> 12:04.740
interested in nothing
but pleasure and amusement.

12:05.460 --> 12:06.100
After all,

12:07.100 --> 12:08.540
what can

12:09.180 --> 12:10.140
a woman possibly do?

12:10.500 --> 12:12.580
Keep a few cats and dogs

12:12.580 --> 12:14.460
as pets to amuse herself.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.260
Maybe accidentally

12:17.060 --> 12:19.860
crush a butterfly or dragonfly.

12:20.260 --> 12:21.620
That's about the worst she could do.

12:22.300 --> 12:25.540
Back then, Luling
had Yu Cheng'an's support.

12:25.660 --> 12:26.980
How powerful she seemed.

12:27.980 --> 12:29.180
But that was all she amounted to.

12:31.860 --> 12:32.300
Your Majesty,

12:34.260 --> 12:35.740
Princess Danyang is kindhearted.

12:37.180 --> 12:38.940
She would never commit such cruel acts.

12:40.980 --> 12:43.260
You seem to know my daughter
better than I do.

12:48.180 --> 12:49.820
A young widow,

12:50.340 --> 12:52.380
with no leverage or powerful allies,

12:52.580 --> 12:54.180
managed, in so little time,

12:54.580 --> 12:56.180
to form an alliance
with her half-brother,

12:56.980 --> 12:59.300
gather devoted admirers
and wait for her chance,

12:59.580 --> 13:00.660
turn the tables,

13:01.340 --> 13:03.660
and bring Yu Cheng'an down overnight.

13:07.180 --> 13:09.700
Luling was so arrogant back then.

13:10.220 --> 13:13.140
Yet all she did was secure
a few official titles

13:13.620 --> 13:14.940
for her male favorites,

13:15.740 --> 13:17.740
filling the court with a few more fools.

13:19.460 --> 13:21.380
But when it comes to stirring up trouble

13:22.380 --> 13:24.620
and turning the entire court

13:25.260 --> 13:26.900
upside down,

13:27.740 --> 13:29.420
she's no match for Wanyao.

13:35.020 --> 13:35.540
What a shame.

13:40.900 --> 13:41.300
Your Majesty,

13:42.380 --> 13:43.500
Princess Danyang is sincere
and devoted to you.

13:44.260 --> 13:45.060
She kept a low profile for years,

13:45.340 --> 13:46.780
all to help you eliminate Yu's faction.

13:47.380 --> 13:48.380
She even risked her own life.

13:49.660 --> 13:50.580
Her intentions are clear,

13:51.100 --> 13:52.060
and her sacrifices deserve compassion.

13:57.580 --> 13:58.700
Are you worried

13:59.020 --> 14:02.100
I'll treat her the way I treated
Meng Zaishi and Lu Yan?

14:11.980 --> 14:12.380
Your Majesty,

14:16.180 --> 14:16.740
the Princess

14:18.860 --> 14:19.900
is merely a woman.

14:21.820 --> 14:22.620
She cannot govern a fief

14:23.380 --> 14:24.060
or command an army.

14:24.940 --> 14:25.700
She could never pose a threat to...

14:26.180 --> 14:26.540
Enough!

14:29.900 --> 14:31.100
Yu Cheng'an's mistake,

14:31.700 --> 14:32.020
I

14:32.940 --> 14:33.900
will not repeat it.

14:48.620 --> 14:49.300
Yan Shang,

14:49.740 --> 14:51.060
have you ever kept a parrot?

14:52.700 --> 14:53.260
Your Majesty,

14:54.060 --> 14:54.460
I have not.

14:55.620 --> 14:57.100
When you keep a parrot,

14:57.420 --> 15:00.300
you must regularly clip its wings.

15:02.780 --> 15:05.860
As a boy, I kept a white parrot.

15:07.220 --> 15:09.660
We spent every day together.

15:10.140 --> 15:12.420
It would even fall asleep
in the palm of my hand.

15:13.180 --> 15:15.660
I taught it every word it knew.

15:17.420 --> 15:18.660
But it was my own fault.

15:18.980 --> 15:20.500
I couldn't bring myself
to clip its wings.

15:21.700 --> 15:22.860
Until one day,

15:23.380 --> 15:24.700
it escaped its cage and flew away.

15:25.820 --> 15:27.540
No matter how often I called,
it wouldn't return.

15:29.380 --> 15:30.540
In a fit of rage,

15:33.260 --> 15:34.220
I shot it down

15:35.420 --> 15:36.580
with my own hands.

15:40.860 --> 15:41.300
What a pity.

15:43.580 --> 15:44.900
That bird could've

15:45.460 --> 15:46.660
lived a very long life.

15:47.500 --> 15:48.420
If only

15:49.500 --> 15:50.580
it hadn't had those wings.

15:51.780 --> 15:52.660
Otherwise,

15:53.700 --> 15:55.460
perhaps it would still be here
with me today.

15:59.180 --> 16:00.380
And you, Yan Shang,

16:01.780 --> 16:02.940
are Wanyao's

16:04.100 --> 16:05.100
pair of wings.

16:10.100 --> 16:10.860
Bring it here.

16:32.820 --> 16:33.340
Princess Danyang!

16:38.020 --> 16:38.700
I demand to see His Majesty!

16:39.220 --> 16:39.780
You can't, Your Highness.

16:40.100 --> 16:41.260
You must be announced first.

16:44.060 --> 16:44.820
On the night of the hunt,

16:45.900 --> 16:46.900
if we'd run into you,

16:47.700 --> 16:48.900
disaster would've struck!

16:49.180 --> 16:49.980
Since the traitor Yu's downfall,

16:50.540 --> 16:51.380
His Majesty has repeatedly ordered us

16:51.660 --> 16:52.340
to tighten security.

16:57.060 --> 16:57.420
Your Highness,

16:58.060 --> 16:58.460
please...

16:59.500 --> 17:00.100
Don't.

17:14.020 --> 17:15.860
Though I'm grateful
for the Princess's support,

17:16.740 --> 17:18.460
I owe my position to Your Majesty.

17:19.420 --> 17:20.900
Naturally, I serve at your command.

17:21.580 --> 17:22.660
Everything I do and think

17:23.420 --> 17:24.420
is for Your Majesty's benefit.

17:25.540 --> 17:26.020
You say

17:26.860 --> 17:28.060
I'm the Princess's wings.

17:29.140 --> 17:30.180
I wouldn't dare claim such importance.

17:31.700 --> 17:33.020
But I can see

17:33.700 --> 17:35.980
you'd risk your life for her,

17:36.300 --> 17:38.060
and she's deeply in love with you.

17:39.260 --> 17:40.100
I'm afraid

17:40.900 --> 17:42.260
your entanglement

17:43.580 --> 17:44.740
has blurred the line between duty
and love.

17:48.020 --> 17:49.020
I wouldn't lie to Your Majesty.

17:50.380 --> 17:51.140
I have indeed

17:51.900 --> 17:52.380
secretly

17:53.260 --> 17:54.500
fallen in love with the Princess.

17:56.140 --> 17:56.460
But

17:57.900 --> 17:58.700
she has

18:00.620 --> 18:02.100
rejected me herself, many times.

18:07.380 --> 18:08.060
I beg Your Majesty

18:09.420 --> 18:10.300
to forgive my recklessness

18:10.860 --> 18:11.340
and my

18:13.060 --> 18:14.060
foolish hopes.

18:24.020 --> 18:25.100
If Your Majesty would show me mercy,

18:26.260 --> 18:26.820
please allow me

18:28.580 --> 18:29.700
to resign and return home.

18:36.300 --> 18:37.660
I'll never set foot in Sheng'an again.

18:39.340 --> 18:39.940
Nor will I...

18:51.340 --> 18:53.380
Nor will I ever go near
the Princess again.

19:09.380 --> 19:10.220
Yan Shang,

19:10.980 --> 19:14.300
did you know that while you were
detained at the Investigation Office,

19:15.660 --> 19:18.100
Wanyao was pleading for your life?

19:18.900 --> 19:21.420
She knelt before me, crying and begging

19:21.980 --> 19:23.580
for a special pardon for you.

19:24.260 --> 19:25.340
Since our dynasty was founded,

19:25.740 --> 19:26.740
only three people

19:27.340 --> 19:28.700
have ever received such a pardon.

19:30.620 --> 19:31.220
I didn't know.

19:31.700 --> 19:32.300
So you see,

19:33.900 --> 19:36.300
as far as I'm concerned, you two

19:37.220 --> 19:38.860
are clearly in love with each other.

19:39.260 --> 19:40.380
You'd entrust each other
with your lives.

19:42.380 --> 19:45.140
It's because she had your help

19:45.540 --> 19:46.860
that she killed Zheng Xing,

19:47.100 --> 19:49.100
defied Meng Zaishi,
and defeated Yu Cheng'an.

19:50.260 --> 19:51.660
What couldn't she accomplish
with you by her side?

20:01.860 --> 20:02.300
Your Majesty,

20:03.500 --> 20:03.940
I...

20:05.540 --> 20:07.300
I'm merely a commoner
from the countryside.

20:08.220 --> 20:09.180
But didn't you just

20:09.940 --> 20:11.180
compare yourself to Mao Sui?

20:12.020 --> 20:14.580
You know, Mao Sui's eloquence

20:14.700 --> 20:16.860
was mightier than an army
of a million men.

20:26.900 --> 20:27.580
But Your Majesty,

20:28.620 --> 20:29.300
your daughter

20:29.940 --> 20:31.900
is nothing like the Crown Prince
or Meng Zaishi.

20:32.980 --> 20:34.580
If they commanded an army of a million,

20:35.020 --> 20:36.700
they'd seek absolute power.

20:37.620 --> 20:38.260
But Wanyao...

20:39.540 --> 20:40.300
All she wants

20:41.860 --> 20:42.700
is freedom.

20:48.380 --> 20:50.540
A bird whose wings haven't been clipped

20:51.420 --> 20:52.900
must be kept in a cage.

20:54.220 --> 20:54.620
Yan Shang,

20:55.180 --> 20:56.660
it's precisely because of you

20:57.060 --> 20:57.620
that Wanyao

20:59.340 --> 21:00.540
is even farther

21:00.980 --> 21:02.100
from her freedom.

21:04.140 --> 21:04.780
Now tell me,

21:06.300 --> 21:07.380
that day at the hunting grounds,

21:07.700 --> 21:09.260
when the two armies faced off,

21:09.620 --> 21:10.700
I seem to recall

21:10.940 --> 21:13.300
you were the first to say
I wasn't there.

21:13.700 --> 21:14.060
Am I right?

21:15.940 --> 21:17.260
The Princess issued a false decree.

21:18.060 --> 21:19.660
Was that her own idea,

21:20.940 --> 21:23.260
or did you put her up to it?

22:15.220 --> 22:15.980
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

22:16.100 --> 22:16.660
Get out of my way!

22:23.260 --> 22:24.060
Yan Shang...

22:28.100 --> 22:29.460
I've doomed you.

22:32.540 --> 22:33.060
I...

22:55.100 --> 23:00.020
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

23:02.180 --> 23:07.540
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

23:09.620 --> 23:15.740
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

23:15.820 --> 23:21.580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

23:23.940 --> 23:29.260
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

23:29.300 --> 23:36.060
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

23:37.500 --> 23:40.520
♪- Soar with the wind;
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

23:40.520 --> 23:42.340
♪Burning bright as a song♪

23:42.820 --> 23:44.020
Yan Shang, receive the imperial decree.

23:44.460 --> 23:45.420
By His Majesty's personal decree:

23:46.020 --> 23:47.620
Yan Shang, Collator at Hongwen Hall,

23:48.140 --> 23:50.300
is well versed in the classics,
and skilled in practical affairs.

23:50.540 --> 23:51.580
I commend him highly.

23:52.180 --> 23:52.980
In recognition of his service,

23:53.180 --> 23:54.460
I hereby grant him three months' leave

23:54.660 --> 23:56.060
to return home and visit his family,

23:56.220 --> 23:57.460
as a mark of imperial favor.

23:57.820 --> 23:58.940
By imperial command!

23:59.900 --> 24:00.620
I, Yan Shang,

24:01.140 --> 24:02.060
gratefully accept Your Majesty's decree.

24:02.060 --> 24:05.820
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

24:05.820 --> 24:09.260
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

24:09.380 --> 24:12.940
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

24:12.980 --> 24:19.820
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

24:20.060 --> 24:21.940
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

24:21.940 --> 24:24.580
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

24:24.660 --> 24:27.180
♪You're the only one I need♪

24:27.220 --> 24:30.700
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

24:30.700 --> 24:34.380
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

24:34.460 --> 24:37.820
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

24:37.900 --> 24:41.300
♪My last untouched innocence♪

24:41.500 --> 24:44.940
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

24:45.180 --> 24:48.620
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

24:48.740 --> 24:55.660
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

24:55.820 --> 24:57.700
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

24:57.700 --> 25:00.340
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

25:00.460 --> 25:03.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

25:03.060 --> 25:06.560
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

25:06.560 --> 25:10.220
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

25:10.260 --> 25:13.660
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

25:13.700 --> 25:17.140
♪The wind blows past us♪

25:17.420 --> 25:22.140
♪- If there's still...
- Some warmth left in this world♪

25:22.780 --> 25:27.260
♪You're the only one I need♪

25:35.820 --> 25:36.580
Collator,

25:37.780 --> 25:39.500
how does the wine taste?

25:40.620 --> 25:41.780
Thank you for the drink, Your Majesty.

25:42.820 --> 25:43.940
It's as sweet as nectar.

25:48.260 --> 25:49.740
That wasn't poisoned wine.

25:49.940 --> 25:51.340
It was just ordinary fruit juice.

25:57.380 --> 25:59.500
But you drank it believing
it was poisoned.

26:00.380 --> 26:01.980
And you drank it without hesitation.

26:04.660 --> 26:08.140
I'm beginning to understand Wanyao now.

26:12.100 --> 26:12.540
Yan Shang,

26:14.100 --> 26:15.860
I've seen your resolve

26:16.940 --> 26:18.140
and your loyalty.

26:20.180 --> 26:21.220
That gives me great comfort.

26:22.700 --> 26:24.500
But as long as I remain her wings,

26:25.580 --> 26:26.100
Your Majesty,

26:27.820 --> 26:28.860
how can you rest easy?

26:29.540 --> 26:31.380
So you still deserve to die.

26:32.460 --> 26:33.700
Just not like this.

26:38.740 --> 26:39.980
Then how would you have me die?

26:41.580 --> 26:42.300
Go to

26:43.220 --> 26:44.580
Lingnan Circuit on my behalf.

26:53.300 --> 26:54.700
I requested leave to visit my family.

26:55.420 --> 26:56.300
There's no need to worry, Your Highness.

26:59.220 --> 27:00.180
Why are your hands so cold?

27:00.820 --> 27:01.420
Tell me.

27:02.060 --> 27:02.820
What happened?

27:04.980 --> 27:05.460
(Yan Shang,)

27:05.940 --> 27:07.420
(it's precisely because of you)

27:07.900 --> 27:08.460
(that Wanyao)

27:09.700 --> 27:10.860
(is even farther)

27:11.380 --> 27:12.420
(from her freedom.)

27:18.060 --> 27:19.140
I'm just going home.

27:21.580 --> 27:22.940
Meng Zaishi has been placed
under house arrest.

27:23.340 --> 27:24.020
I thought

27:24.420 --> 27:24.740
you...

27:27.060 --> 27:27.580
I'm fine.

27:28.140 --> 27:29.100
Then why are you going to Lingnan?

27:31.100 --> 27:31.780
To go home

27:32.220 --> 27:32.900
and see my father,

27:33.660 --> 27:34.740
Xiaozhou, and my elder brother.

27:35.660 --> 27:36.340
His Majesty has shown me kindness.

27:37.140 --> 27:37.860
I'm very happy.

27:38.340 --> 27:39.340
He's forcing you to go.

27:42.580 --> 27:43.700
I'm going of my own free will.

27:48.500 --> 27:48.900
Oh, and...

27:50.180 --> 27:51.460
The bamboo at my house...

27:52.380 --> 27:53.820
Please take good care of it for me.

27:54.260 --> 27:54.700
And

27:55.420 --> 27:57.020
please leave the swallow's nest alone.

27:57.580 --> 27:58.780
The swallows will return in spring.

27:59.060 --> 28:00.820
And you should be back by then.

28:05.940 --> 28:06.860
Come on. Come home with me.

28:07.100 --> 28:08.100
I'll help you pack.

28:08.300 --> 28:08.940
That won't be necessary.

28:13.860 --> 28:15.020
I'll have someone

28:15.820 --> 28:16.660
make the arrangements for him.

28:26.900 --> 28:28.660
I thank Your Majesty
for your generosity.

28:29.460 --> 28:31.020
The Princess thinks highly of you.

28:32.340 --> 28:34.740
I'm merely showing favor
to someone she cares for.

28:43.620 --> 28:45.060
Father, if you're so considerate
of those I care for,

28:46.020 --> 28:46.980
why won't you let me

28:47.500 --> 28:49.020
take Yan Shang home to rest for a while?

28:49.300 --> 28:50.140
Because

28:51.260 --> 28:53.220
I have other plans for you.

28:54.660 --> 28:56.900
Starting today,
you'll stay at Lizheng Hall

28:57.220 --> 28:59.260
and copy Buddhist scriptures
to pray for your late mother.

29:00.940 --> 29:02.420
So I can't leave
without imperial permission?

29:02.900 --> 29:03.380
Your Majesty,

29:04.260 --> 29:05.540
why must you confine the Princess?

29:07.780 --> 29:08.660
Wanyao,

29:09.500 --> 29:10.660
when your mother was alive,

29:10.780 --> 29:12.020
her favorite scripture

29:12.420 --> 29:13.740
was the Lotus Sutra.

29:14.100 --> 29:15.700
Copy the sutra in her memory,

29:16.460 --> 29:17.820
to bring peace to her soul

29:18.500 --> 29:20.300
and pray for her blessings
and absolution.

29:20.740 --> 29:21.860
The Lotus Sutra has a hundred
thousand characters.

29:22.900 --> 29:24.380
It'll take at least a hundred days
to copy.

29:24.820 --> 29:27.260
So, Yan Shang, you may return home
without worry.

29:27.780 --> 29:29.020
By the time you return,

29:29.540 --> 29:30.540
I'm sure the Princess

29:31.140 --> 29:31.980
will have finished copying it.

29:45.780 --> 29:46.540
Father, since you've given your orders,

29:47.980 --> 29:48.940
I dare not disobey.

29:52.900 --> 29:53.300
Let's go.

30:46.420 --> 30:47.540
It's a long journey ahead.

30:48.020 --> 30:49.060
I let my emotions get the better of me.

30:49.940 --> 30:50.860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

30:57.100 --> 30:58.140
You're forgiven.

31:02.900 --> 31:03.260
Wanyao?

31:14.060 --> 31:18.900
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

31:21.100 --> 31:26.420
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

31:26.660 --> 31:30.620
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies;
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

31:30.620 --> 31:36.480
♪- Burning bright as a song;
- Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

31:36.580 --> 31:41.500
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

31:41.660 --> 31:46.380
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

31:46.420 --> 31:48.260
♪Not a single hour less♪

31:48.300 --> 31:52.220
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

31:52.220 --> 31:56.060
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

31:56.140 --> 31:59.500
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

31:59.660 --> 32:03.140
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

32:03.340 --> 32:10.220
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

32:10.420 --> 32:12.300
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

32:12.300 --> 32:14.940
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

32:14.980 --> 32:17.540
♪You're the only one I need♪
(Lizheng Hall)

32:17.580 --> 32:22.500
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

32:22.500 --> 32:24.020
Princess Danyang, please go inside.

32:24.780 --> 32:28.180
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

32:28.260 --> 32:31.660
♪My last untouched innocence♪

32:31.980 --> 32:35.420
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

32:35.660 --> 32:39.100
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

32:39.260 --> 32:46.140
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

32:46.300 --> 32:48.180
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

32:48.180 --> 32:50.820
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

32:50.940 --> 32:53.500
♪You're the only one I need♪

32:53.540 --> 32:57.160
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

32:57.160 --> 33:00.700
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

33:00.740 --> 33:04.140
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

33:04.700 --> 33:05.220
Mr. Liu,

33:05.700 --> 33:08.180
we've securely packed all the gifts
for Mr. Yan.

33:19.540 --> 33:19.980
Yan Shang,

33:21.140 --> 33:21.980
I really envy you.

33:23.500 --> 33:24.340
Look how far you've come.

33:25.500 --> 33:26.340
You passed the imperial examinations,

33:27.140 --> 33:27.940
rose through the ranks,

33:28.740 --> 33:29.460
received imperial honors,

33:30.500 --> 33:31.260
and now you're returning home in glory.

33:32.940 --> 33:34.660
There was a time when I thought

33:35.300 --> 33:36.420
coming to Sheng'an

33:37.820 --> 33:39.060
would set me on the same path.

33:48.220 --> 33:48.660
(Wenji,)

33:50.100 --> 33:50.940
(if only you knew.)

33:52.340 --> 33:53.500
(These are all gifts from His Majesty)

33:54.460 --> 33:55.540
(to accompany me to my grave.)

33:59.860 --> 34:00.740
When you return to Lingnan,

34:01.340 --> 34:02.020
if you have time,

34:02.620 --> 34:03.660
please, on my behalf...

34:12.100 --> 34:12.980
Please, on my behalf...

34:17.860 --> 34:18.420
Mr. Liu,

34:19.020 --> 34:20.780
when will you return to the palace
to report back?

34:26.780 --> 34:27.940
You needn't say another word.

34:29.060 --> 34:29.700
I understand.

34:43.660 --> 34:48.380
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

34:48.740 --> 34:52.820
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

34:53.020 --> 34:57.980
♪Dusk falls on the horizon,
sorrow and joy stretch far♪

34:58.380 --> 35:02.220
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

35:02.900 --> 35:07.740
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

35:08.020 --> 35:11.580
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

35:12.540 --> 35:17.260
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

35:17.900 --> 35:21.900
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

35:30.100 --> 35:30.940
Will these plum blossoms

35:32.260 --> 35:33.420
still be blooming in April?

35:41.420 --> 35:42.900
When I left for North Jing that year,

35:44.180 --> 35:45.020
the blossoms had already faded.

35:47.300 --> 35:47.900
Back then,

35:50.020 --> 35:51.820
Mother was confined to this very palace.

35:53.100 --> 35:54.580
Such beautiful plum blossoms...

35:58.260 --> 35:59.460
Mother never got to see them.

36:09.620 --> 36:10.860
If Chunhua were still here,

36:12.940 --> 36:13.580
she'd be

36:16.580 --> 36:18.380
fussing over me and shutting
the window by now.

36:19.660 --> 36:20.820
You're already feeling troubled,
Your Highness.

36:21.620 --> 36:22.820
You really shouldn't sit
in the cold wind.

36:30.340 --> 36:31.380
Try not to dwell on it.

36:31.980 --> 36:34.300
The sooner you finish copying the sutra,
the sooner you can leave.

36:34.820 --> 36:35.620
I'll prepare some ink for you.

36:46.820 --> 36:47.780
This palace hall...

36:49.820 --> 36:50.740
This imperial city...

36:52.700 --> 36:53.900
This entire realm of Huai...

36:56.100 --> 36:57.260
Where could I possibly go?

37:01.380 --> 37:02.740
I could bring down Yu Cheng'an,

37:05.100 --> 37:06.660
but I could never bring him down.

37:08.820 --> 37:09.420
In fact,

37:11.460 --> 37:13.100
I could never even bring myself
to act against him.

37:16.940 --> 37:18.100
I'll always have to

37:18.860 --> 37:19.700
live under his authority,

37:20.460 --> 37:21.340
letting him

37:22.940 --> 37:24.420
decide whether we're free

37:25.620 --> 37:26.340
and whether we live or die.

37:41.420 --> 37:43.340
This was the last place Mother
ever stayed.

37:45.660 --> 37:46.140
Cailian!

37:48.460 --> 37:48.860
Yes, Your Highness?

37:49.580 --> 37:50.220
Help me look around.

37:50.780 --> 37:52.660
See if anything from three years ago
is still here.

37:53.180 --> 37:53.620
Yes, Your Highness.

38:04.700 --> 38:05.660
Is that Yan Shang's carriage?

38:10.300 --> 38:10.740
Wei Shu?

38:20.220 --> 38:21.260
So it seems

38:22.340 --> 38:23.260
you and I

38:24.060 --> 38:25.220
will be heading to opposite ends
of the country.

38:26.460 --> 38:27.460
Who knows

38:28.260 --> 38:29.340
when we'll meet again?

38:31.980 --> 38:33.500
Our hometowns are thousands
of miles apart,

38:34.740 --> 38:36.860
yet we still managed to meet
in a city as vast as Sheng'an.

38:38.300 --> 38:39.460
As for where fate might lead us,

38:42.380 --> 38:43.340
who knows?

38:47.820 --> 38:48.460
It's just...

38:50.300 --> 38:51.820
I thought after everything
that happened,

38:52.860 --> 38:54.540
His Majesty might reward your service

38:55.220 --> 38:56.100
by arranging a marriage

38:56.780 --> 38:57.700
between you and Princess Danyang.

39:06.340 --> 39:06.740
Wei Shu.

39:10.940 --> 39:11.300
Yan Shang.

39:29.940 --> 39:30.820
Where I'm going

39:31.780 --> 39:32.460
is very warm.

39:34.860 --> 39:35.260
Wei Shu.

39:44.780 --> 39:45.220
Take care.

40:03.580 --> 40:04.020
You too.

40:11.420 --> 40:12.180
Everything is here.

40:13.020 --> 40:15.380
I heard there used to be some books,
calligraphy, and paintings

40:15.700 --> 40:16.460
that Her Majesty kept

40:16.460 --> 40:18.580
to pass the time during her months
of recovery here.

40:19.380 --> 40:20.100
But

40:20.740 --> 40:22.100
after Her Majesty passed away,

40:22.580 --> 40:23.700
His Majesty ordered

40:24.180 --> 40:25.420
that they all be burned
as offerings to her.

41:09.860 --> 41:10.300
Cailian,

41:11.540 --> 41:12.500
I'd like to be alone for a while.

41:13.380 --> 41:13.780
Yes, Your Highness.

41:24.820 --> 41:25.420
(Wanyao,)

41:27.060 --> 41:28.780
(my heart aches for you,
still in the bloom of youth,)

41:30.060 --> 41:31.700
(yet so determined
to serve your country.)

41:33.900 --> 41:35.060
(That a princess must shed blood
and tears)

41:35.700 --> 41:36.820
(to safeguard the realm)

41:38.620 --> 41:40.500
(is a failure on the part
of your father and mother.)

41:43.620 --> 41:44.900
(Confined within these walls,)

41:46.300 --> 41:47.500
(I am powerless to help you.)

41:49.100 --> 41:50.420
(The pain tears at my heart.)

41:52.980 --> 41:55.100
(As you embark
upon this perilous journey,)

41:56.580 --> 41:58.300
(may your resolve remain
as strong as iron and stone,)

41:59.580 --> 42:00.660
(unbroken by a hundred trials,)

42:02.060 --> 42:03.340
(and never be shaken.)

42:06.220 --> 42:07.020
(My child,)

42:07.980 --> 42:10.220
(now that you have left
these palace walls far behind,)

42:11.980 --> 42:14.340
(I too must do what must be done.)

42:16.300 --> 42:17.820
(As long as I draw breath,)

42:19.620 --> 42:21.260
(I shall remain unyielding,
even in the face of death,)

42:22.980 --> 42:24.580
(with neither regret nor remorse.)

42:39.420 --> 42:42.780
(Written by Your Mother)

43:27.020 --> 43:28.100
How much farther to Baqiao?

43:30.420 --> 43:32.260
You must've been lost in thought, sir.

43:32.860 --> 43:33.980
We passed it long ago.

43:34.180 --> 43:35.260
We're almost at Lantian.

43:40.700 --> 43:41.300
(Yan Shang,)

43:42.300 --> 43:43.260
(have you really thought this through?)

43:44.100 --> 43:45.940
(Sheng'an is no easy place to survive.)

43:47.140 --> 43:48.180
(Every ruthless predator)

43:48.380 --> 43:50.460
(in Huai is gathered there.)

43:51.140 --> 43:52.380
(Whatever you compete in,
be it intelligence,)

43:52.740 --> 43:53.500
(scheming,)

43:53.820 --> 43:54.580
(flattery,)

43:55.060 --> 43:55.740
(or influence,)

43:56.420 --> 43:57.620
(someone will always
be better than you.)

43:58.700 --> 43:59.660
(Every day,)

44:00.060 --> 44:00.900
(every moment,)

44:01.740 --> 44:03.140
(they fight viciously for power.)

44:09.340 --> 44:10.100
(And you...)

44:10.660 --> 44:12.180
(Don't think that just
because you're clever,)

44:12.860 --> 44:15.420
(you'll make a name for yourself
at the Imperial Academy.)

44:15.980 --> 44:17.420
(I grew up in Sheng'an.)

44:18.020 --> 44:20.940
(I've seen countless brilliant,
gifted people)

44:21.220 --> 44:22.100
(go unrecognized)

44:22.540 --> 44:23.300
(and spend their lives in obscurity.)

44:28.220 --> 44:28.660
Yan Shang,

44:29.220 --> 44:30.100
if you dare repeat

44:31.260 --> 44:32.780
a word of what I said today
to anyone else,

44:33.500 --> 44:35.180
I'll skin you alive!

44:35.660 --> 44:36.220
I promise

44:36.660 --> 44:37.500
I won't tell a soul.

44:44.580 --> 44:45.340
Forgive me, sir.

44:46.020 --> 44:47.380
Are you all right?

45:15.060 --> 45:19.820
(Next Episode Preview)

45:20.020 --> 45:20.940
We're like

45:22.100 --> 45:23.980
lambs to the slaughter.

45:24.540 --> 45:25.860
Going to Lingnan is a suicidal move

45:26.300 --> 45:27.740
for Yan Shang.

45:28.300 --> 45:30.780
Xun, you indeed know more than I do.

45:31.300 --> 45:32.180
What's really going on

45:32.980 --> 45:34.060
in Lingnan?

45:36.401 --> 45:39.694
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:42.379 --> 45:47.295
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:49.489 --> 45:55.334
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:55.834 --> 46:01.060
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:03.829 --> 46:08.620
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:09.456 --> 46:15.535
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:17.336 --> 46:20.486
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:20.486 --> 46:22.134
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:22.186 --> 46:25.910
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:26.288 --> 46:30.954
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:31.573 --> 46:35.614
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:36.105 --> 46:38.220
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:38.260 --> 46:45.206
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:45.969 --> 46:49.422
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:49.602 --> 46:52.747
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:53.186 --> 46:59.823
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:00.220 --> 47:02.258
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:02.258 --> 47:04.734
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:04.772 --> 47:07.241
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:07.445 --> 47:14.332
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:14.644 --> 47:17.915
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:18.220 --> 47:21.393
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:21.717 --> 47:25.143
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:25.376 --> 47:28.601
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:28.932 --> 47:35.728
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:36.097 --> 47:38.159
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:38.160 --> 47:40.663
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:40.710 --> 47:43.048
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:43.279 --> 47:50.114
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:50.463 --> 47:52.081
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:52.211 --> 47:54.007
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:54.364 --> 47:57.381
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:57.421 --> 47:58.748
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

47:58.748 --> 47:59.748
